2. Optimization approach
I recommend a controlled three-buffer pipeline.
Proposed bitmap pipeline
Buffer A — Decoder

Receives the next JPEG frame


Buffer B — Pending frame

Holds the newest decoded frame


Buffer C — Rendering

UI draws without decoder modification

Conceptual ownership model. Buffers must be recycled only after their previous owner releases them.
This should reduce allocation pressure and prevent outdated frames from accumulating. It does not guarantee faster JPEG decoding, so we'll measure that independently.

